    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>GutenTOC is an SEO-friendly customizable block for the WordPress block editor (Gutenberg).<br />\nIt scans headings through your page or post content and creates the table of contents (TOC) automatically.</p>\n<h4>Supporting Future Development</h4>\n<p>If you like this plugin, please rate and review it here in the WordPress Plugin Directory.<br />\nThank you for your support!</p>\n<h3>How to Add a Block</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the block editor.  </li>\n<li>Add a block by searching for “TOC” or “Table of Contents”.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically generate a table of contents with the GutenTOC block.  </li>\n<li>Auto-generated anchors (customizable if needed).  </li>\n<li>SEO friendly (anchors display nicely in SERPs).  </li>\n<li>Option to toggle TOC visibility.  </li>\n<li>Counter bullet formats: none, decimal, numeric, icon.  </li>\n<li>Smooth scrolling to headings.  </li>\n<li>Customizable styles: background color, border color, text color, font settings, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>Automatic Installation</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Requires WordPress 5.0 or higher.</li>\n<li>Go to WordPress admin <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New.  </li>\n<li>Search for “GutenTOC”.  </li>\n<li>Install and activate.  </li>\n<li>Add the “GutenTOC” block inside the editor.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20i%20get%20support%20for%20using%20the%20block%3F'>\nCan I get support for using the block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, we reply to every question in the support forum.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20this%20plugin%20slow%20down%20my%20website%3F'>\nDoes this plugin slow down my website?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. The plugin has almost no impact on page load for visitors.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='is%20this%20plugin%20free%3F'>\nIs this plugin free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it is completely free.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added TOC alignment option  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WordPress 5.5 compatibility  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed extra editor core CSS  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed scrolling issue  </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added options: Font Size, Line Height, Font Weight, Font Family, Letter Spacing, Text Color, Hover Color, Hover Underline</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "GutenTOC is an SEO-friendly Table of Contents builder block for the WordPress block editor.   It scans headings in your content and automatically gene &hellip;",
    "description": "<p>GutenTOC is an SEO-friendly customizable block for the WordPress block editor (Gutenberg).<br />\nIt scans headings through your page or post content and creates the table of contents (TOC) automatically.</p>\n<h4>Supporting Future Development</h4>\n<p>If you like this plugin, please rate and review it here in the WordPress Plugin Directory.<br />\nThank you for your support!</p>\n<h3>How to Add a Block</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the block editor.  </li>\n<li>Add a block by searching for “TOC” or “Table of Contents”.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatically generate a table of contents with the GutenTOC block.  </li>\n<li>Auto-generated anchors (customizable if needed).  </li>\n<li>SEO friendly (anchors display nicely in SERPs).  </li>\n<li>Option to toggle TOC visibility.  </li>\n<li>Counter bullet formats: none, decimal, numeric, icon.  </li>\n<li>Smooth scrolling to headings.  </li>\n<li>Customizable styles: background color, border color, text color, font settings, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n",
    "download_link": "https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/gutentoc-advance-table-of-content.2.1.0.zip",
